  "content": "<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b0a307fc-da28-41b0-adc7-6c1c39291e2a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"256\"></strong></p><h1>📜說明</h1><p><span style=\"color:#c2235e\"><strong>Cataclysm: Spellbooks（災厄：法術書）</strong></span>是同時為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks（鐵的法術與法術書）</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender's Cataclysm（L_Ender 的災厄）</a> 設計的附加模組。</p><p>目前此模組總共新增了 <strong>65</strong> 種新法術，未來還計劃增加更多。該模組還新增了一個新的法術學派：<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1;text-decoration:underline\"><em>深淵（Abyssal）</em></span></span><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"> </span>和<span style=\"color:#843fa1\"> </span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1;text-decoration:underline\"><em><span style=\"color:#34495e;text-decoration:underline\">機械魔法（Technomancy）</span></em></span></span>。深淵學派包含所有與<span style=\"color:#843fa1\">利維坦（Leviathan）</span>相關的法術，而機械魔法則靈感來自於<span style=\"color:#34495e\">預兆者（The Harbinger）</span>。</p><p><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><em>注意：此模組仍在開發中，後續將持續新增法術！</em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><em>注意2：「玩家，請安裝 Azurelib。」開發者懇求道。然後開發者倒下了，再也沒起來。</em></span></strong></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong><em>注意3：不再支援 1.20.1 版本。請勿將此模組回溯移植或重新上傳至任何網站。</em></strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:left\">若想查看計劃中的法術清單，請前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/AceTheEldritchKing/Cataclysm_Spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 頁面</a>查看！</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/c8zY8fDYXz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_aeffb23a-0e37-44ba-9321-8e639672834e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"192\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/SCprzpvhK8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_eefc4371-f197-4e88-a5ca-9d369c18f408.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"192\"></a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">🔗連結</h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/c8zY8fDYXz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7a4fcb4e-d28f-4544-b647-f1470c52b2ba.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/SCprzpvhK8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1d1e389d-cf70-413b-a4f7-5d3cd5fbc578.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/0starocean0/Cataclysm_Spellbooks_1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c813cc04-ef46-4605-8c2e-a5ef231f42bb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/AceTheEldritchKing/Cataclysm_Spellbooks_1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c813cc04-ef46-4605-8c2e-a5ef231f42bb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/AceTheEldritchKing/Cataclysm_Spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c813cc04-ef46-4605-8c2e-a5ef231f42bb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fcataclysm-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.